      {
        "finding": "ASAM improves both CNNs but worsens both transformers; GSAM improves only ResNet50, CR-SAM only VGG16, and WSAM improves none.",
        "proposed_claim": "Benefits of SAM variants on breast ultrasound classification depend on architecture and optimizer.",
